            "content": "<p>When a shipping carrier and tracking service are used, tracking details will generally be included in the shipment confirmation notification or made available in your order-status information.</p><p>Tracking updates may take time to appear after the shipping label is created. If you have questions, contact us with your order number and the tracking information available to you.</p>"
